      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Vera 05 · 11 Show a file with buttons\nSends a stored photo or paper to one person with answer buttons: the engineer approving a fixed item, a Vera reviewer filing an item. The file is uploaded to WhatsApp as media, so no public link to evidence ever exists.\n\nGenerated from `n8n/mobilise/workflows.mjs`. Edit there and rebuild; edits made here are overwritten on the next import.\nEach node's note says what it does and which guardrails it carries.",
